          "title": "Hollfahren",
          "subtitle": "Gambling",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Hollfahren is a historical German card game using playing cards and a circular layout or special board whose centre was called hell."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Hollfahren literally means going to hell and refers to players advancing toward the centre of a circular layout. It is a historical German layout game with gambling or race-like pressure."
            }
          ]
        },
